  "description": "Display formatting, ported 1:1 from the web SDK (fields/format.js), plus the holder rule. formatExpiry has an `inserting` flag: true while typing, false while deleting (so backspace can remove the \" / \"). Formatting never changes the validated value of number, expiry and cvv. holder: every edit is upper-cased with the locale-independent Unicode mapping (i -> I, ı -> I, ə -> Ə), nothing else changes; validation then runs on the upper-cased text. See CONTRACT.md §16.4. Card numbers stop at 16 digits (owner decision 2026-10-21).",
